  spiralos-docs [name]                 handbooks;  man spiralos-<command> for each command
  spiralos-install-check, spiralos-install   check this PC / installation guide (live system)
  spiralos-sound on|off|test                login sound
  spiralos-flash on|off|status               flash mode: logs only in RAM, written to disk only on a crash (SD cards)
